    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classastrea_1_1trace_1_1FoldsOfCoverage" kindref="compound">FoldsOfCoverage</ref> class represents the folds of coverage (simultaneous accesses) for each receiver ID over time. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It calculates the number of accesses (folds) for each receiver ID at each time point based on the provided <ref refid="classastrea_1_1trace_1_1AccessArray" kindref="compound">AccessArray</ref> and time parameters. It also computes statistics for the folds of coverage for each receiver ID. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
